WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.380
Roosevelt: "We are now in this war,

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.440
We're all in it..

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.380
All the way.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.600
Every single man, woman and child

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:16.180
..is a partner in the most tremendous under taking of our American history

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.600
but all of us can have that deep and permanent inner satisfaction,

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.920
that comes from doing the best we know how."

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.160
Let's hear it for Captain America!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.260
It's not gonna be a safe landing, I gotta put her in the water!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.020
Steve!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:55.900
Nick Fury: "You've been asleep, Cap

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.880
For almost 70 years.."

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.520
You're here with a mission sir?

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:00.900
Captain America: "Trying to get me back in the world?"

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.460
Trying to save it.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.120
Most of the intelligence community doesn't believe he exists

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:15.700
The ones that do call him the "Winter Soldier"

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:22.140
Bucky?!

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.300
Who the hell is Bucky?

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.600
BUCKY, NOW!

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.360
Black Widow: "He's credited with over two dozen assassinations

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.180
in the last 50 years."

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.200
Captain America: "You're a wanted man

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:37.980
..And they're not planning on taking you alive."

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.620
Black Widow: "I know how much Bucky means to you..

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:43.800
..stay out of this one.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:45.680
Please,

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.860
You'll only make this worse."

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:48.880
Captain America: "You're saying you'll arrest me?"

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.880
Captain.. you seem a little defensive.

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.580
Well it's been a long day.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:58.840
Captain America: "Sorry Tony.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.240
You know I wouldn't do this if I had any other choice

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:04.640
But he's my friend"

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:08.500
So was I.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.180
Captain America: "You gave me this mission..

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.160
This is how it ends."

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:14.580
Iron Man: "You just started a war!"

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.080
Iron Man: "You chose the wrong side."

